---
/**
 * Visually hidden until focused. The first focusable thing on every route,
 * so a keyboard user does not have to tab through the nav to reach content.
 * Targets #main-content, which BaseLayout puts on <main>.
 *
 * -translate-y-16 is Tailwind's default transform scale, not the project's
 * spacing tokens — it is exempt from the "no arbitrary values" rule because
 * it isn't a spacing/rhythm decision, just "far enough off-screen to hide."
 * Every value that IS spacing or type (position, padding, size) reads gutter
 * or the declared type scale instead.
 */
---

<a
  href="#main-content"
  class="stencil bg-safety-text text-safety-face focus-visible:outline-safety-text duration-mark top-gutter left-gutter p-gutter text-mark fixed z-50 -translate-y-16 uppercase transition-transform focus:translate-y-0"
>
  Skip to content
</a>
